{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101080","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110108001:0":{"text":"휴... 사막에서 그냥 걷는 것도 정말 힘드네요. 꽤 상쾌하긴 하지만요.","source_cn":"呼……在沙漠里前行还真费劲，虽然是很干爽啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED1BFA733C81168E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110108002:0":{"text":"콜록콜록, 갑자기 흙먼지가 많아졌어요! 치피, 아까 그 트레져 햄스터가 뭘 조심하라고 했었지?","source_cn":"咳咳，空气里忽然好多沙尘！满满，寻宝仓鼠让我们提防什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1CE877F17863B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110108003:0":{"text":"...붕괴, 야수, 모래 폭풍? 이 소리는, 모래 폭풍이야! 어서 도망쳐요!","source_cn":"……塌方，野兽，沙暴？这声音，是沙暴！快跑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F36162678BF2D20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}